              "text": "ಪರಿಚಾರಕ — paricāraka — \"a waiter; an attendant\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಪರಿಚಾರಕ ನಮಗೆ ಬಿಸಿ ಕಾಫಿ ತಂದನು. paricāraka namage bisi kāphi tandanu. The waiter brought us hot coffee."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: ಪರಿಚಾರಕರು, paricārakaru."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A formal word; people often call out ಸರ್ or ಅಣ್ಣ to a waiter."
            }
          ]
        },
